{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Gods hunger for tribute! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You build a web of settlements. Each has inputs and outputs. Link them and caravans flow. Every leg they travel adds value. Every incoming road grows the town it delivers goods to.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624110/extras/018e72cacebd035b89f20a7d4e99fc09.poster.avif?t=1765485490\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624110/extras/018e72cacebd035b89f20a7d4e99fc09.webm?t=1765485490\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624110/extras/018e72cacebd035b89f20a7d4e99fc09.mp4?t=1765485490\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each temple demands a single sacred resource associated with its god. Your job is to shape long, efficient routes that end with the right goods at the right shrines. Please a god and they shower you with gifts that twist the rules and open new lines of play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624110/extras/8afcd7039329ecfeef7a0e67d133963a.poster.avif?t=1765485490\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624110/extras/8afcd7039329ecfeef7a0e67d133963a.webm?t=1765485490\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624110/extras/8afcd7039329ecfeef7a0e67d133963a.mp4?t=1765485490\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prophet Margin is a thinky, refined strategy game with strong <i>Eurogame</i> board-game DNA. It trades 4X micromanagement for clean decisions, readable systems, and satisfying network puzzles that reward planning.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Place with purpose.</strong> Position complementary settlements so inputs feed outputs without waste.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weave profitable routes.</strong> Chain multi-stop caravans that snowball in value with every city they pass.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Serve the pantheon.</strong> Deliver the exact resource each temple wants to receive divine gifts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grow by connection.</strong> Every incoming road upgrades a settlement, unlocking tougher choices and bigger payoffs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Think, don\u2019t grind.</strong> Tight rules, clear feedback, and depth without spreadsheets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless divine variety.</strong> Each map is randomly generated - offering new synergies, challenges, celestial quests and miraculous chains every run.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3624110?t=1765485490","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624110/8d2181eb521677c1b07677f32367084efa41ba3f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765485490","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624110/68210a5765ba4f237492ad78aa176d62159db097/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765485490","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624110/68210a5765ba4f237492ad78aa176d62159db097/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765485490","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Gods hunger for tribute! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You build a web of settlements. Each has inputs and outputs. Link them and caravans flow. Every leg they travel adds value. Every incoming road grows the town it delivers goods to.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624110/extras/018e72cacebd035b89f20a7d4e99fc09.poster.avif?t=1765485490\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624110/extras/018e72cacebd035b89f20a7d4e99fc09.webm?t=1765485490\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624110/extras/018e72cacebd035b89f20a7d4e99fc09.mp4?t=1765485490\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each temple demands a single sacred resource associated with its god. Your job is to shape long, efficient routes that end with the right goods at the right shrines. Please a god and they shower you with gifts that twist the rules and open new lines of play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624110/extras/8afcd7039329ecfeef7a0e67d133963a.poster.avif?t=1765485490\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624110/extras/8afcd7039329ecfeef7a0e67d133963a.webm?t=1765485490\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624110/extras/8afcd7039329ecfeef7a0e67d133963a.mp4?t=1765485490\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prophet Margin is a thinky, refined strategy game with strong <i>Eurogame</i> board-game DNA. It trades 4X micromanagement for clean decisions, readable systems, and satisfying network puzzles that reward planning.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Place with purpose.</strong> Position complementary settlements so inputs feed outputs without waste.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weave profitable routes.</strong> Chain multi-stop caravans that snowball in value with every city they pass.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Serve the pantheon.</strong> Deliver the exact resource each temple wants to receive divine gifts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grow by connection.</strong> Every incoming road upgrades a settlement, unlocking tougher choices and bigger payoffs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Think, don\u2019t grind.</strong> Tight rules, clear feedback, and depth without spreadsheets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless divine variety.</strong> Each map is randomly generated - offering new synergies, challenges, celestial quests and miraculous chains every run.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Stellar Cartography Interactive UG"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624110/7a73169289deb3398597412d6e5049771e125c92/header.jpg?t=1765485490","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 13<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Any 64 bit<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1600 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 15<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 or better<br></li><li><stron